{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERDURE is an odd generator of plants and trees! It is a creative sandbox where you can trim branches and experiment with growth controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no story or strict objective. VERDURE is for open-ended plant design, whether\u00a0shaping a small bonsai tree, letting maple branches sprawl freely, or exploring how different settings affect them. The original soundtrack, retro visuals, and little hands-on growth interactions make the game peculiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plant is generated from a unique recipe that can be customized through more than 20 parameters, including trunk length, branch thickness, foliage distribution, and color palettes. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a random seed or design your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim and prune branches, or let them grow organically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit combinations of backgrounds, foregrounds, and pots to suit your composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust growth speed and hide the interface for a more focused experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a collection of personal favorites across 50+ save slots, with indicative names like \u2018Cactus,\u2019 \u2018Pine,\u2019 or \u2018Sakura\u2019</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERDURE can be enjoyed in short, fidget-friendly sessions or over longer periods to gradually expand your collection and refine each plant\u2019s design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069810?t=1768678080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/e53776c131bcec855cb8beece4ccc506b9fb84a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768678080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/9797c253c1254312f8fe643d997a38006cfb379b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768678080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/9797c253c1254312f8fe643d997a38006cfb379b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768678080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/extras/61467e36ecda90dccbfa73083597a1b9.poster.avif?t=1768678080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/extras/61467e36ecda90dccbfa73083597a1b9.webm?t=1768678080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/extras/61467e36ecda90dccbfa73083597a1b9.mp4?t=1768678080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFO catcher!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERDURE is an odd generator of plants and trees! It is a creative sandbox where you can trim branches and experiment with growth controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no story or strict objective. VERDURE is for open-ended plant design, whether\u00a0shaping a small bonsai tree, letting maple branches sprawl freely, or exploring how different settings affect them. The original soundtrack, retro visuals, and little hands-on growth interactions make the game peculiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plant is generated from a unique recipe that can be customized through more than 20 parameters, including trunk length, branch thickness, foliage distribution, and color palettes. You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a random seed or design your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trim and prune branches, or let them grow organically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit combinations of backgrounds, foregrounds, and pots to suit your composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust growth speed and hide the interface for a more focused experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a collection of personal favorites across 50+ save slots, with indicative names like \u2018Cactus,\u2019 \u2018Pine,\u2019 or \u2018Sakura\u2019</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERDURE can be enjoyed in short, fidget-friendly sessions or over longer periods to gradually expand your collection and refine each plant\u2019s design.</p>","developers":["LXP"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069810/c3db783ee4e60bf151258b0abba82ea6a3ce157e/header.jpg?t=1768678080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069810/358121501/187e90e99a663cc40acef3a8961090b31cf0671e/1765122866/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765124353","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4069810/358121501/187e90e99a663cc40acef3a8961090b31cf0671e/1765122866/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765124353","highlight":true,"hls